# "This land enters tapped unless you control an Equipment" (CR 614.1d). Turn 1: no Equipment, tapped. Turn 3: Bot2 controls a
# Skullclamp but Bot1 does not, so the second land is tapped too (the opponent's Equipment is not "you control"). Bot1 then
# casts its own Skullclamp, and on turn 5 the third land enters untapped. The land's own mana ability ({T}: Add {R}, from
# its Mountain type, CR 305.6) taps the untapped ones for the Skullclamp.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Lonely Mountain
The Lonely Mountain
The Lonely Mountain
Skullclamp
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Skullclamp
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.The Lonely Mountain.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain.Tapped = true
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Skullclamp.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.The Lonely Mountain.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain#2.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skullclamp.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.The Lonely Mountain.Play
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain#3.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.The Lonely Mountain#2.Tapped = false
